{"task_id": "e22bb7e027fed409", "model_key": "deepseek-v4-1-flash", "raw_response": "Solving:\n- From \\(-4x_2 + 4x_3 = 8\\), we get \\(x_3 = x_2 + 2\\).\n- Substitute into the third equation: \\(-2x_1 + 4x_2 - 4(x_2+2) = -8\\), giving \\(x_1 = 0\\).\n- Substitute into the first equation: \\(3(0) + 2x_2 + 2(x_2+2) = 0\\), so \\(4x_2 + 4 = 0\\), hence \\(x_2 = -1\\).\n- Then \\(x_3 = -1 + 2 = 1\\).\n\n{\"answer\": [0, -1, 1]}", "parsed_answer": "[0, -1, 1]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 5833, "usage": {"input": 312, "output": 451, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 294, "totalTokens": 763, "cost": {"input": 4.68e-05, "output": 0.00027059999999999996, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.00031739999999999996}}, "cost_usd": 0.00031739999999999996, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "api": "openai-completions", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "0217923759343432b8720b6d986e81ce95e9b006de0a2cbb23740"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:11+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-19T02:12:17+00:00"}
